LAB=lab-tracepoint-skb-path
DATE=2026-06-06T16:15:07+08:00
本脚本使用稳定 tracepoint 观察 skb 收包路径（netif_receive_skb + napi_gro_receive_entry）。

## tracepoints used
tracepoint:net:netif_receive_skb
tracepoint:net:napi_gro_receive_entry

## generated script
tracepoint:net:netif_receive_skb
{
    @rx_total = count();
    @rx_by_cpu[cpu] = count();
    @rx_by_name[args->name] = count();
}

tracepoint:net:napi_gro_receive_entry
{
    @gro_entry_total = count();
    @gro_by_cpu[cpu] = count();
    @gro_by_name[args->name] = count();
}

interval:s:1
{
    printf("=== skb RX tracepoint === @ %ds ===\n", elapsed);
    print(@rx_total);
    print(@rx_by_cpu);
    print(@rx_by_name);
    print(@gro_entry_total);
    print(@gro_by_cpu);
    print(@gro_by_name);
}

